Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 19:12:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 253/307] !B (Terrain Plate) Hide sunken plates and retain LOD
 0 over integrated geometry.

Keep terrain sectors at LOD 0 where integrated objects overlap so decimated
terrain cannot reveal geometry intended to remain below ground. Add a temporary
whole-plate hide for fully buried plates.
