+//! So: when the plate is entirely under the ground, stop its camera draw. At LOD 0 that changes nothing
+//! - the terrain was covering it anyway - and at every coarser LOD there is now nothing left to poke
+//! through. It is deliberately an ALL OR NOTHING test: a plate with any part above the terrain keeps
+//! drawing, because the crossing region is a per triangle problem and belongs to decision 06 C4.
